-- Classic 1.60: NPCs, spawns and patrol paths from official Forever sniffs (beta builds 70245-70450)
-- Data source: Azeroth project, Sakhwoow/WoWForever (GPL-2). English names from Wowhead Forever; their guids remapped to 43000000+
-- (theirs collide with ours); spawns within 5 yd of the same NPC already in ours left out; Botika Montes 277765 left out (no English name).
-- Liv Bradford 203475 has no vendor flag: the sniff shows the flag but no items.

-- 23 creature templates
DELETE FROM `creature_template` WHERE `entry` IN (203475,203478,214589,230319,248753,256337,259642,272391,273264,274921,274926,276591,276802,277037,277062,277067,277285,277402,277723,277728,277766,278105,278116);
